 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">has_role CHEBI:76969</bp:comment>
 <bp:comment rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An indoleacetaldehyde that is acetaldehyde in which one of the methyl hydrogens are replaced by a indol-3-yl group. It is an intermediate metabolite in the metabolism of tryptophan.</bp:comment>
